 Students demonstrate in Rome during a nationwide general strike in Italy today. Photo: Antonio Masiello/Getty Images 🪧 Workers and students protested in more than 100 cities across Italy today during a 24-hour general strike called over rising costs, military spending and more. Go deeper . 🏗️ President Trump said that he would block U.S. companies from building data centers overseas, or impose a "tremendous tax" on those that do. Go deeper . 🇷🇺 🇵🇱 A Russian missile's crash in Poland today was likely an intentional provocation timed to European military drills elsewhere in the country, Polish Prime Minister Donald Tusk said. Go deeper . 
 
